/S /P
/P 434 0 R
/E (The star schema with tbl_Students at the center reflects the real-world structure of school data, every piece of information \(grades, lifestyle, family background, school life\) belongs to a student. The 5 active relationships confirm the model is correctly built. The presence of School_Name and Age_Group as calculated columns directly on tbl_Students shows deliberate design thinking, bringing frequently-needed attributes close to the central table to avoid multi-hop filter problems encountered during development.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [9]
>>
